<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-093" chapter-id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling" source-id="s-songshu-093-ruanwanling-ws1962755">
  <p id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p001:m0000" ref="wv8_l6v_kp9">阮萬齡</persName>，陳留尉氏人也。祖<persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p001:m0012" ref="03n_n2r_8rt">思曠</persName>，左光祿大夫。父<persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p001:m0022" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_B">寧</persName>，黃門侍郎。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p002:m0000" ref="wv8_l6v_kp9">萬齡</persName>少知名，自通直郎爲<persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p002:m0011" ref="70y_je5_bm0">孟昶</persName>建威長史。時<persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p002:m0019" ref="xxh_xtr_3f9">袁豹</persName>、<persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p002:m0022" ref="f8f_8b2_11c">江夷</persName>相係爲<persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p002:m0027" ref="70y_je5_bm0">昶</persName>司馬，時人謂<persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p002:m0034" ref="70y_je5_bm0">昶</persName>府有三素望。<persName id="c-songshu-093-ruanwanling:p002:m0041" ref="wv8_l6v_kp9">萬齡</persName>家在會稽剡縣，頗有素情，永初末，自侍中解職東歸，徴爲祕書監，加給事中，不就。尋除左民尚書，復起應命，遷太常，出爲湘州刺史，在州無政績。還爲東陽太守，又被免。復爲散騎常侍、金紫光祿大夫。元嘉二十五年卒，時年七十二。</p>
</text>
